'''Volume 1''' is the first volume published by [[Shogakukan]] compiling chapters from the {{MangaArc|X & Y}} of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga created by [[Hidenori Kusaka]] and [[Satoshi Yamamoto]]. The chapters in this volume are collected directly from the magazine publication of Pokémon Adventures and were collected in the regular volumes once the {{MangaArc|Black 2 & White 2}} had finished. 

